feedscan — RSS poller, SQLite storage.

Structure:
- src/feedscan/cli.py, fetch.py, parse.py, store.py
- tests/

Conventions:
- Test files are named *_test.py
- Line length is 100 characters, enforced by ruff
- Type hints on every function
- Network access only through fetch.py

The RSS date parser returns None for dates it cannot read instead of raising.

Do not add new dependencies without asking.
